{
  "slug": "veteran-of-the-apocalypse",
  "title": "Veteran of the Apocalypse",
  "author": "",
  "description": "Veteran of the Apocalypse Manhwa He was just an ordinary man running a small restaurant. But behind that quiet life hid his true identity… A legendary hardcore veteran who spent thousands of hours mastering a zombie-survival VR game. Then one day, the world changed. The virtual battleground he had died and revived in countless times suddenly became reality. A sudden zombie apocalypse erupts. At the same moment, he awakens a mysterious ability to open dimensional gates— allowing him to travel freely between Earth and another world to prepare for the coming end. Soon, familiar figures from his gaming past begin to “log in” to reality: the infinitely respawning Rabbit Princess, the monster-controlling DuckButt-QuackQuack, and other absurdly overpowered comrades from the old days. Civilization collapses. The line between humanity and survival instinct grows faint. But he stands firm. “This isn’t a game. But for me… it’s a battlefield I know better than anyone.” As the strongest former players gather at the end of the world, one final choice awaits them all 아포칼립스의 고인물, The Apocalypse’s Ultimate Veteran, The Apocalypses Veteran",
